<dialog aria-labelledby="application-title" class="application-dialog" data-application-dialog>
  <form class="application-form" data-application-form method="dialog">
    <div class="application-head">
      <div>
        <p data-application-eyebrow>무료 도입 신청</p>
        <h2 data-application-title id="application-title">BATON을 무료로 시작해 보세요</h2>
        <span data-application-plan></span>
      </div>
      <button aria-label="신청폼 닫기" class="application-close" data-application-close type="button">×</button>
    </div>

    <p class="application-intro" data-application-intro>
      필요한 정보를 먼저 확인한 뒤, 채널톡에서 도입 상담을 이어갑니다.
    </p>

    <div class="application-fields">
      <label>
        회사명 <em>필수</em>
        <input autocomplete="organization" name="company" required type="text" />
      </label>
      <label>
        담당자명 <em>필수</em>
        <input autocomplete="name" name="name" required type="text" />
      </label>
      <label>
        업무용 이메일 <em>필수</em>
        <input autocomplete="email" name="email" required type="email" />
      </label>
      <label>
        연락처 <span>선택</span>
        <input autocomplete="tel" name="phone" type="tel" />
      </label>
      <label class="application-wide">
        예상 사용자 수 <em>필수</em>
        <select name="teamSize" required>
          <option value="" selected disabled>선택해 주세요</option>
          <option>1–10명</option>
          <option>11–30명</option>
          <option>31–100명</option>
          <option>101명 이상</option>
        </select>
      </label>
    </div>

    <p class="application-privacy">제출하면 위 정보가 채널톡 대화 입력창에 채워집니다. 메시지는 직접 전송하기 전까지 접수되지 않습니다.</p>

    <div class="application-actions">
      <button class="btn-outline" data-application-cancel data-application-close type="button">취소</button>
      <button class="btn-primary" type="submit"><span data-application-submit>신청하기</span></button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>

<style>
  .application-dialog {
    width: min(560px, calc(100% - 32px));
    max-height: min(760px, calc(100svh - 32px));
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 70%);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 32px 90px rgb(15 23 39 / 24%);
  }

  .application-dialog::backdrop {
    background: rgb(15 23 39 / 42%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
  }

  .application-form {
    padding: 28px;
  }

  .application-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .application-head p {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .application-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 5vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .application-head span {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-top: 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--blue-soft);
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    padding: 5px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .application-close {
    display: grid;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    flex: none;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--sub);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .application-intro {
    margin: 18px 0 22px;
    color: var(--sub);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .application-fields {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .application-fields label {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .application-fields label em {
    margin-left: 4px;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .application-fields label span {
    margin-left: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .application-fields input,
  .application-fields select {
    width: 100%;
    height: 46px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--body);
    padding: 0 12px;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 500;
    outline: none;
  }

  .application-fields input:focus,
  .application-fields select:focus {
    border-color: var(--blue);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue-soft);
  }

  .application-wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .application-privacy {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .application-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .application-form {
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .application-fields {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .application-actions > * {
      flex: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
